5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we should prioritize empirical evidence over artistic renderings. I'll be looking into the longevity of our previous efforts.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I am concerned about the actual feasibility of construction and the reliability of the firms involved.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I want to make sure we don't pick something that's too expensive to keep up later. Let's be smart!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the operational side. We need to know who is actually available to maintain the site daily.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to understand how the land and the people actually use the space. Paper plans often ignore reality.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, since you mentioned feasibility, perhaps we should coordinate our research to cover both the build and the aftermath.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"That sounds reasonable, Benjamin. I'll focus on the immediate risks of the ground and the contractors.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm curious about how much we've been spending lately! I'll check the ledgers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll also look into the current staffing levels to see if we have the manpower for complex designs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I'll be looking at the drainage and the way people move through the park on weekdays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
