60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Given the failure of the eastern avenue trees, Option B is a gamble. Option C is durable but risky to build.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option D is the most practical. It's in the south, meaning we can hoard it in stages without closing the park.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm still scared of the costs, but if the volunteers handle the sports side, it might be cheaper than a forest!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option D aligns perfectly with our current staffing and volunteer strengths. It's the only logical choice for maintenance.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,It solves the commuter issue by keeping the ground firm and avoids the heat/drainage issues of a paved plaza.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,I find the argument for Option D quite compelling. It avoids the pitfalls of our previous failures.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It minimizes the risk of soil slippage compared to the heavy digging required for wetlands.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mio,,"If everyone is sure it won't break the bank, I'm on board! It sounds like a fun place anyway!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It is the only plan that doesn't rely on a staff we no longer have.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,It respects the actual behavior of the people using the park. I vote for D.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Let us proceed with the most rational choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mio,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
